{'@type':'Question',name:'What compounding frequencies can I use?',acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer',text:'Choose daily (n = 365), monthly (n = 12), quarterly (n = 4), half-yearly (n = 2), or yearly (n = 1). Match the frequency your account or investment quotes.'}},
{'@type':'Question',name:'How do monthly contributions work?',acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer',text:'Optional monthly deposits are added using the future value of an ordinary annuity at the effective monthly rate derived from your compounding setting. Total invested is principal plus all contributions; interest is final amount minus total invested.'}},
